WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.720
- As promised earlier in this show,

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:05.370
vision board maker expert
Ron Funches has returned

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:08.090
to help us make a vision
board for America,

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:09.160
because let's be honest,

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.719
we could use a little vision

00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:13.200
