00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.970
ain't it funny that its 2020,

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:16.945
and I'm saying a better vision, its funny

00:00:16.945 --> 00:00:19.380
so Ron, has it been harder for you

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.250
