00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:24.090
- A little bit, it depends on the day?

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.060
And I think that's what we have

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:26.750
to give ourselves as human beings,

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:29.680
it's okay to feel down,
it's okay to feel sad,

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:31.210
it's okay to feel angry,

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.310
but then it's also okay to feel happy

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:36.270
and enjoy your friends
and the people around you

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:37.540
and keep your happiness,

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.860
I think that's something
I've been really focusing on.

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:42.110
- Well Ron it looks like
you have a nice set up there

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:43.660
so is that a felt board?

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:47.200
- Yeah, I've been upgrading.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.108
- Lemme, lemme upgrade you.

00:00:48.108 --> 00:00:51.271
(both laughing)

00:00:51.271 --> 00:00:54.630
That's awesome, okay so let's
build the board together,

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:56.563
what do you have to put
on it? What's on it?

00:00:56.563 --> 00:00:58.260
