00:00:58.260 --> 00:00:59.290
some things are new

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:00.620
and some things say the same,

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:02.777
The Rock boom, right in the middle.

00:01:02.777 --> 00:01:03.610
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:05.952
He's still there, 'cause
I think he's needed now

00:01:05.952 --> 00:01:07.640
more than ever.

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:10.271
- I know, no hell I'd vote
for him at this point.

00:01:10.271 --> 00:01:12.320
(both laughing)

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:15.780
- Absolutely and also I wanna
work with him on a new TV show

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:18.350
he's making, if he watches this show.

00:01:18.350 --> 00:01:21.506
- This looks good together (Ron laughs)

00:01:21.506 --> 00:01:23.330
I think that this is
yes, it's gonna happen,

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:24.500
so what's next?

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:27.110
- But like you said, we gotta
voting ballot right there

00:01:27.110 --> 00:01:28.310
because we gotta vote,

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:31.750
we gotta vote things are going ways that,

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:34.250
no matter what you feel change is needed,

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:36.210
we need some sensibility

00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:37.440
we've gotta get out there and vote,

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:39.079
you gotta let your voice be heard.

00:01:39.079 --> 00:01:39.912
- Amen, yeah.

00:01:39.912 --> 00:01:41.000
- I got a mask here because you've

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.558
gotta wear that mask .
- Yes.

00:01:42.558 --> 00:01:43.950
- Some people are not wearing masks

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:45.840
and they got to, they got to,

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:47.760
my mom lives in Phoenix, Arizona,

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:49.120
and she says, she goes out shopping

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:50.470
and nobody's wearing that mask

00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:51.720
and I get worried about her,

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:53.930
so please wear your mask.

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:55.400
- It's just kind, yep.

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:56.643
- It's just kindness.

00:01:57.521 --> 00:01:59.560
- And it's smart, so what's next?

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:01.540
