00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:03.220
because we gotta have liberty

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:04.980
and I think right now this is something

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:07.860
that we need to remember is
our ideals, our principle,

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.858
what this country was founded on,

00:02:09.858 --> 00:02:12.440
and just remember where we came from

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:14.300
just so we can get to where we need to go

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.730
I think that's important.

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:17.800
- Absolutely, okay what's next?

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:19.660
- I got my own private island

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:21.325
